  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB02310",
    "sub_id": "51698",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>The description of the scoring rules is shown below:&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Evaluation of this course will be based on attendance, case analysis, class discussion, paper presentation, and the final project.</div>\n\n<div>The assessment methods of this course are as follows:</div>\n\n<div>Each week, every student&#39;s Class Attendance 10%</div>\n\n<div>Each week, every student&#39;s Participation (including class discussion) 20%</div>\n\n<div>Case Analysis:&nbsp;&nbsp;we will have three case analyses.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Paper Presentation: each&nbsp;group needs to present two assigned journal paper 25%</div>\n\n<div>Final Group Project 25%</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "請尊重老師及同學發言，如需打斷，請先舉手請求同意。\n網路討論版的使用，請遵守網路禮節，勿攻擊其他人言論，可以善意討論。",
    "course_pol_en": "Please respect the lecturer and other classmates, If you need to interrupt, please raise your hand and ask for permission first.\nWhen you participate in an online online discussion board, please observe Internet etiquette, do not attack other people's opinions discuss in good faith.\nIf you use online resources, please remember to cite the resources adequately.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>課堂討論每位同學都需要發表意見，不管是贊同或者不同意老師或同學觀點都沒關係，重點是要提出自己的看法與觀點。</div>\n\n<div>學期報告及報告論文需要自己準備、閱讀並且製作報告檔案，如果能設計與其他同學的互動會更好。</div>\n\n<div>請勿抄襲以及複製網路上的資源且未正確引用。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Students are required to express their opinions, whether they agree or disagree with the teacher or classmates, it does not matter, the main point is to put forward their own opinions and viewpoints.<br />\nSemester reports and essays should be prepared, read, and written on your own, and it is better if you can design interactions with other students.<br />\nPlease do not plagiarize or copy online resources without proper citation.</div>\n\n<div>If you use Generative AI as your tool, please indicate your prompts and how you collaborate with Genereative AI.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
